<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Drums</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">dearALICE</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">bitterSWEETsummer</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">13SjpKF8cMCuZR8IUlGrqW</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:00.018" end="00:01.557">Here come the drums</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:01.557" end="00:03.616">Rum pum pum pum</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:03.616" end="00:05.116">Rum pum pum pum</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:04.610" end="00:06.492">Here come the drums</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:06.492" end="00:08.961">Rum pum pum pum</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:08.961" end="00:10.461" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:09.660" end="00:12.295">You know she making that body roll down like a baseline</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.295" end="00:15.034">She hittin' that on a roll baddest of all time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.034" end="00:17.522">Got me making the news for what we about to do</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.522" end="00:19.680">It's the truth I'm kinda down for that</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.680" end="00:21.629">Heartbeat drummin' it's hard to miss</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.629" end="00:24.130">I can feel it from my toes up to my lips</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.130" end="00:26.170">Run the beat like an alchemist</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.170" end="00:29.163">Runnin' this every day every night pad locked in</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.163" end="00:30.663" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.353" end="00:31.366">I hit the note and you feel it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.366" end="00:33.970">Up and down double time we so in it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.970" end="00:36.456">Clock in the overtime we ain't finished</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.456" end="00:38.771">Wonder woman come on you got no limits</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.771" end="00:40.271">Show me that</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.480" end="00:40.980">Baby didn't come to play</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.884" end="00:43.355">Blow my mind to my brain that's miles away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.355" end="00:44.855">I'm all in jump in</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.477" end="00:45.977">I ain't on the fence</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.671" end="00:47.171">Yeah the sign said lock it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.933" end="00:50.431">Girl you know it makes sense</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.431" end="00:51.931" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.999" end="00:55.849">If I go if I go insane</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.849" end="00:58.179">You're the one you're the one to blame</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.179" end="01:00.370">Lighting's about to strike</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.370" end="01:02.735">You know the warning signs</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.735" end="01:05.176">Everytime you hear that sound</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.176" end="01:06.914">Ain't nowhere to run</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.914" end="01:08.414" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.074" end="01:08.781">Here come the drums</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.781" end="01:10.917">Rum pum pum pum</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.917" end="01:12.417">Rum pum pum pum</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.782" end="01:13.584">Here come the drums</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.584" end="01:15.084">Rum pum pum pum</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.760" end="01:16.565">Got you feeling dizzy from my drums</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.565" end="01:18.284">Here come the drums</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.284" end="01:20.410">Rum pum pum pum</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.410" end="01:21.910">Rum pum pum pum</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.277" end="01:23.221">Here come the drums</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.221" end="01:24.721">Rum pum pum pum</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.283" end="01:25.791">Baby I can take it give me more</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.791" end="01:27.291" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.928" end="01:27.428">Damn tryna not forget</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.404" end="01:28.904">Oh the mess we're in</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.843" end="01:31.251">She an angel but she acting so devilish</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.251" end="01:33.692">I'm tired of playing the games don't wanna know the way</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.692" end="01:36.387">She tryna pick up the pace even though it was a race</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.387" end="01:37.887">Fee-fi-fo-fum</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.617" end="01:39.117">Caffeine four shot</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.916" end="01:41.101">Running my engine I'm not gon' stop</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.101" end="01:43.482">Camera lights shut your eyes when we touch</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.482" end="01:45.850">We about to be hit with the head rush</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.850" end="01:47.350" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.051" end="01:48.132">I hit the note and you feel it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.132" end="01:50.758">Up and down double time we so in it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.758" end="01:53.149">Clock in the overtime we ain't finished</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.149" end="01:55.600">Wonder woman come on you got no limits</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.600" end="01:57.100">Show me that</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.087" end="01:57.681">Baby didn't come to play</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.681" end="02:00.181">Blow my mind to my brain that's miles away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.181" end="02:02.741">Rockstar double kick shake the ground</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.741" end="02:06.334">Heart stop on the edge don't look down</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.334" end="02:07.834" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.722" end="02:12.590">If I go if I go insane</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.590" end="02:14.783">You're the one you're the one to blame</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.783" end="02:17.137">Lighting's about to strike</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:17.137" end="02:19.490">You know the warning signs</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.490" end="02:21.953">Everytime you hear that sound</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:21.953" end="02:23.724">Ain't nowhere to run</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:23.724" end="02:25.224" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:23.901" end="02:25.583">Here come the drums</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:25.583" end="02:27.598">Rum pum pum pum</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:27.598" end="02:29.098">Rum pum pum pum</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:28.561" end="02:30.207">Here come the drums</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:30.207" end="02:31.707">Rum pum pum pum</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:31.532" end="02:33.353">Got you feeling dizzy from my drums</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:33.353" end="02:35.163">Here come the drums</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:35.163" end="02:37.323">Rum pum pum pum</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:37.323" end="02:38.823">Rum pum pum pum</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:38.137" end="02:39.753">Here come the drums</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:39.753" end="02:41.253">Rum pum pum pum</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:41.182" end="02:46.981">Baby I can take it give me more</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:46.981" end="02:48.481" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:47.250" end="02:51.250">Come to play</p></div></body></tt>